        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Hope%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "New Hope sits at an elevation of one thousand forty feet above sea level just north of the Applegate River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Hope%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Applegate River valley around New Hope was originally home to the Takelma and Shasta tribes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/new_hope_oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Gold discoveries in the early eighteen fifties triggered the broader settlement wave that created the region encompassing New Hope.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
