      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/new_hope_oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "New Hope developed within a fertile valley known for its agricultural heritage, including award-winning vineyards and wineries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
